join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": It will be the most marvelous offering… yes. If only the damned thing would come out.
join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": Come here birdy! Feeding time!
leave "Porcelain Figure"
join Gli left
Gli: (Is she trying to catch Angel?)
Gli: Angel!
join Gli left
leave Gli
join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": Bah! I almost had it!
join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": You! You scared it away.
leave "Porcelain Figure"
The woman looks at you with a menacing glare.
label choice_loop
- I'm sorry I didn't mean to. | [if {picked_a} == false]
	set {picked_a} = true
	join "Porcelain Figure" right
	"Porcelain Figure": Regardless of your intentions, you did it. Didn't you, Gli?
	"Porcelain Figure": Be grateful for the Guardian's mercy.
	join Gli left
	Gli: Sorry, do i know you?
	join "Porcelain Figure" right
	"Porcelain Figure": I know YOU. That's for sure.
	jump choice_loop
- Angel doesn't eat that. | [if {picked_b} == false]
	set {picked_b} = true
	join Gli left
	Gli: The crows- they're different. They like to eat seeds.
	join "Porcelain Figure" right
	"Porcelain Figure": Do they, now?
	jump choice_loop
- Offering? | [if {picked_c} == false]
	set {picked_c} = true
	join "Porcelain Figure" right
	"Porcelain Figure": Yes, Gli. Finally, we are ridding ourselves of this plague you brought upon us.
	jump choice_loop
if {picked_a} == false:
	jump choice_loop
elif {picked_b} == false:
	jump choice_loop
elif {picked_c} == false:
	jump choice_loop
join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": Come here, let me take a look at you.
join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": You bent the world out of shape.
join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": You taught the birds to sing, thinking that'll make it better.
leave "Porcelain Figure"
leave Gli
join "Porcelain Figure" right
"Porcelain Figure": It's like you said... They're not like us. And neither are you.
join Gli left
Gli: You're not making any sense, lady...
Gli: Hey! Back off!
[signal arg="battle_start"]
[end_timeline]